      "created_at": "2012-05-23T01:39:14.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Well, the Two Man Army was introduced before the H mechanic was introduced. And since the core game was balanced for 4 players, it implied that Two Man Army is meant to be tackled with H = 4.</p>",
